        ],
        "text": "The authors give a multinomial expression for the stabilizer partition function of n copies of a single-qubit pure state, with a closed expression for T-state copies, and claim that T-state copies are distinguished from stabilizer states for every nonzero beta. This is an unverified author-claim candidate."
      }
